// Groups of the API reference. Each entry below puts a declaration into one of the
// groups that structure the sidebar of the generated documentation.
// Declarations that are not listed here show up in "Other types".
//
// The order of the sidebar follows the length of the group names (see
// flatten_groups.py), so keep them non-decreasing in length.

/** @defgroup grp_api API classes
 *  The classes that make up the public API. Start with VirtualC64; the other classes are reached through its members (for example `cpu` or `drive8`).
 */

/** @defgroup grp_config Configuration
 *  Options and the structures that report the configuration of a component.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_states State and metrics
 *  Structures that describe the state of a component, as returned by getInfo(), getCachedInfo(), getMetrics() and similar functions.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_messages Messages
 *  The messages the emulator sends to the front-end, and the callback that receives them.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_exceptions Errors
 *  Exceptions thrown by API functions.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_mediafiles Media files
 *  Snapshots, media files and their types.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_enumerations Enumerations
 *  Enumerations used in the signatures of the API.
 */

/** @defgroup grp_commandqueue Commands
 *  The raw command interface (advanced, see the danger zone of VirtualC64).
 */

/** @defgroup grp_miscellaneous Other types
 *  Miscellaneous types.
 */

